OL,3,GNEWSASecond church lead theft 'another
OL,4,Ablow', warden says
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe warden of a 12th Century Surrey
OL,7,Fchurch which had the lead stolen from
OL,8,Fits roof says the damage is "just
OL,9,Fanother blow" to the community coming
OL,10,Fweeks after its sister site was also
OL,11,Ftargeted.
OL,13,FThe theft at the Grade II* listed St
OL,14,FMary's Church in Staines became
OL,15,Fapparent when churchgoers arrived on
OL,16,FSunday to find water leaking into the
OL,17,Fvestry due to the damage.
OL,19,FIt came two weeks after St Peter's
OL,20,FChurch was also targeted by thieves -
OL,21,Fwhich had been described as a "punch in
OL,22,Fthe gut" for the community.
OL,23,APub: 19-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,327,320,200,140,0,100
